					"height": 80,
					"sizingX": "move",
					"textAlign": "center",
					"text": "The \"wk image expression\" attribute can be associated to anchored pictures. Pictures returned by expressions are displayed as soon as the expression is associated."
				},
				"Texte1": {
					"type": "text",
					"top": 410,
					"left": 680,
					"width": 280,
					"height": 80,
					"sizingX": "move",
					"textAlign": "center",
					"text": "As with all other attributes, \"wk image expression\" can be reset. The image remains, but no longer depends on the expression."
				},
				"Texte2": {
					"type": "text",
					"top": 250,
					"left": 680,
					"width": 280,
					"height": 80,
					"sizingX": "move",
					"textAlign": "center",
					"text": "All expressions associated to the document can be updated using the ST COMPUTE EXPRESSION command. This is also the case for anchored images."
				},
				"Texte3": {
					"type": "text",
					"top": 570,
					"left": 680,
					"width": 280,
					"height": 80,
					"sizingX": "move",
					"textAlign": "center",
					"text": "The \"ST Freeze expression\" command does nearly the same thing as \"WP Reset attribute\" except that the expression is recalculated before beeing frozen."
				},
